    "7f39058b710a21449d62d7dee5730d986f878b3cea5342e8ca9cb46ab1e22a06": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "e44dd2b8288df9d5187cff40a7e0d42bd6e13692aef0707c7fcc624b884a69ac",
      "contextFingerprint": "9a51603633bf76b915759b5d0aefdccc90f359aeb7e5e7f6137548744fcccf12",
      "sourceText": "回调没有按消息header.frame_id转换位姿、没有使用其协方差，也没有按消息时间查TF，而是取最新变换；收到首帧扫描前，扫描frame_id还为空，查询可能失败。手动设初值只改当前和下一轮匹配猜测，不会重转PCD，也不清空已累计点。云台快速转动时，人工位姿对应的朝向与最新TF是否同一时刻也要核对。",
      "translatedText": "The callback does not transform the pose according to the message header.frame_id, does not use its covariance, and does not look up TF by message time; instead, it takes the latest transform\\. Before the first scan is received, the scan frame_id is still empty, so the query may fail\\. Manually setting the initial value only changes the current and next matching guesses; it does not re\\-transform the PCD, nor does it clear the accumulated points\\. When the gimbal rotates rapidly, it is also necessary to verify whether the orientation corresponding to the manual pose and the latest TF are at the same time\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 235,
        "outputTokens": 145,
        "costUsd": 0.000245
      }
